close https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw/pull/11122
close https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw/pull/6731

- `ExcalidrawAPI.scrollToContent(target?, opts?)` was replaced with `ExcalidrawAPI.setViewport(opts | null)`.

  ```tsx
  // before
  excalidrawAPI.scrollToContent(element, { fitToViewport: true, animate: true });
  // after
  excalidrawAPI.setViewport({ target: element, fit: "contain" });
  ```
- Added `setViewport({ ..., lock })` to lock the viewport 
- Added `<Excalidraw initialState={{ viewport }} />` for initializing the viewport 

see [CHANGELOG](https://github.com/excalidraw/excalidraw/blob/mtolmacs%2Ffeat%2Fconstrained-pan-zoom/packages/excalidraw/CHANGELOG.md) for details.
